      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ CM700 Reboot Workflow - WORKING\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Gets RouterStatus.htm page\n2. Extracts dynamic session ID from form\n3. POSTs to /goform/RouterStatus?id=<session_id>\n4. Sends buttonSelect=2 (reboot command)\n5. Waits 90 seconds for modem to reboot\n6. Verifies modem is back online\n\n**Authentication verified working!**\n\n**Optional Enhancements:**\n- Replace Manual Trigger with Schedule Trigger for automatic reboots\n- Add notification nodes (Email, Slack, etc.) after \"Verify Modem Online\"\n- Add error handling to retry if reboot fails\n\n**To schedule automatic reboots:**\nReplace the Manual Trigger with a Schedule Trigger node and set it to run at your preferred time (e.g., 3 AM weekly).",
